<title>BELGIUM: Weissmann to present BSE report to Commission on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Weissmann to present BSE report to Commission on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new report on mad cow disease will be presented to the European Commission next week, a spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Professor Charles Weissmann of Switzerland will present his review of the existing research on BSE (Bovine Spongiform Encephalopathy) on Wednesday next week,&quot; a Commission official said.</p>
<p>Weissmann, a leading BSE expert, was nominated by Farm Commissioner Franz Fischler in March to head a group of experts to look into the transmission of BSE to humans.</p>
<p>The group was also asked to look into the control of BSE, to examine existing BSE research and to set priorities for future BSE research.</p>
